  "book_id": "rashomon-stories",
  "chunk_id": "rashomon-stories-chunk-0829",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00829",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“嗯——不，我只认得雄的丈夫。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Um, no, I only know the male one's husband.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00829",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我老婆觉得那个雄的是坏蛋，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My wife thinks that male is a villain,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00829",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "可我觉得与其说他是坏蛋，毋宁说他是患了被害妄想症的疯子，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but to me he seems less a villain than a madman suffering from persecution mania,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00829",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "成天害怕被雌河童捉住……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "afraid all day long that he would be caught by a female kappa...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00829",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "后来，雌河童在老公的可乐里放了氰化钾。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Later, the female kappa put potassium cyanide in her husband's cola.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00829",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "不晓得为什么搞错了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Somehow, for reasons no one knows, she made a mistake,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00829",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "又把它拿给客人水獭喝了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and served it to an otter guest to drink.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00829",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "水獭这下呜呼哀哉了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The otter promptly met his end.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00829",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "接着……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "And then...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
